"The instructions in this manual are for three buttoned, right-handed mouse "
"devices, the most common type. If you use another type of mouse or pointing "
"device, you should take care to locate the corresponding buttons on your "
"mouse. If you use a left-handed mouse, see the paragraph on setting mouse "
"orientation below."
msgstr ""
"本手冊的操作說明適用於最常見的三鍵右手滑鼠裝置。如果您使用其他類型的滑鼠或指"
"向裝置，請注意找出對應的按鍵。如果您使用左手滑鼠，請參閱下方關於設定滑鼠方向"
"的段落。"

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gosbasic.xml:65
msgid ""
"If you set your mouse device to be left-handed, you should reverse the mouse"
" button conventions used in this manual. This is normally also implied in "
"most documentation and in many applications."
msgstr ""
"如果您將滑鼠裝置設定為左手使用，應反轉本手冊中的滑鼠按鍵慣例。多數文件與應用"
"程式通常也暗含此意。"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosbasic.xml:69
msgid ""
"Some mice lack a middle button. If you have a two-button mouse device, then "
"your system may be configured to use <firstterm>chording</firstterm> to "
"allow middle button simulation. If chording is activated, you press the left"
" and right mouse buttons simultaneously, to simulate the the middle mouse "
"button. A middle mouse button is by no means necessary to use MATE."
msgstr ""
"有些滑鼠沒有中鍵。如果您的滑鼠只有兩個按鍵，系統可能設定為使用<firstterm>按鍵"
"和弦</firstterm>來模擬中鍵。啟用按鍵和弦後，同時按下左右滑鼠按鍵即可模擬中鍵"
"。使用 MATE 並不需要中鍵。"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosbasic.xml:74
