msgid ""
"The file browser's location bar can show either a location field, a button "
"bar, or a search field. Each is useful in different situations."
msgstr ""
"檔案瀏覽器的位置列可以顯示位置欄位、按鈕列或搜尋欄位。每個在不同情況下都很實"
