" applications to read the file. For example, an email application can use "
"the <literal>image/png</literal> MIME type to detect that a PNG file is "
"attached to an email."
msgstr ""
"選取此選項即可依物件類型以字母順序排序項目。項目會依其<firstterm>MIME 類型</"
"firstterm>的描述以字母順序排序。MIME 類型會識別檔案的格式，並讓應用程式可以讀"
"取檔案。例如，電子郵件應用程式可以使用 <literal>image/png</literal> MIME 類型"
