"Some dialogs do not allow you to interact with the main application window "
"until you have closed them: these are called <firstterm>modal</firstterm> "
"dialogs. Others can be left open while you work with the main application "
"window: these are called <firstterm>transient</firstterm> dialogs."
msgstr ""
"有些對話框不允許您在關閉它們之前與主應用程式視窗互動：這些稱為<firstterm>強"
"制</firstterm>對話框。其他對話框可以在您使用主應用程式視窗時保持開啟：這些稱"
"為<firstterm>暫時</firstterm>對話框。"

#. (itstool) path: tip/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:182
msgid ""
"You can select the text in a dialog with the mouse. This allows you to copy "
"it to the clipboard (by right-clicking the text and selecting "
"<guilabel>Copy</guilabel>), and paste it into another application. This is "
"useful if you wish to quote the text you see in a dialog when requesting "
"support on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用滑鼠選取對話框中的文字。這讓您可以將它複製到剪貼簿（在文字上按滑鼠"
"右鍵並選取 <guilabel>複製</guilabel>），然後貼到另一個應用程式。如果您想在網"
"際網路上請求支援時引用在對話框中看到的文字，這就很有用。"

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:188
msgid "Manipulating Windows"
msgstr "操作視窗"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:193
msgid ""
"You can change the size and position of windows on the screen. This allows "
"you to see more than one application and do different tasks at the same "
"time. For example, you might want to read text on a web page while writing "
"with a word processor, or to change to another application to do a different"
" task or check its progress."
msgstr ""
"您可以變更視窗在螢幕上的大小與位置。這讓您可以同時查看多個應用程式並執行不同"
"的工作。例如，您可能想在用文書處理器撰寫文字時閱讀網頁上的文字，或切換到另一"
"個應用程式執行不同的工作或檢查進度。"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:195
msgid ""
